thubusercontent.com/u/20694052?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui","html_url":"https://github.com/PhoebeHui","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"PhoebeHui","id":20694052,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjk0MDUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20694052?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui","html_url":"https://github.com/PhoebeHui","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2020-02-12T23:08:08Z","updated_at":"2020-03-11T01:28:36Z","closed_at":"2020-03-11T01:28:35Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhile Freetype itself builds fine, linkage into an actual project causes a build failure. Specifically, it is looking for harfbuzz-related objects, which naturally cannot be found as of #9888 .\r\n\r\n**Environment**\r\n- OS: Linux (Ubuntu 18.04)\r\n- Compiler: vcpkg dependencies - g++8, linking project - Clang 8.0.1\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Set up a Ubuntu instance that does not have, or depend on, Harfbuzz as a core OS library (so no GNOME, for example).\r\n1. Install Freetype (./vcpkg install freetype).\r\n2. Link to Freetype in an application.\r\n3. Observe the issue when performing a build of said application.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe build should be succeeding without Harfbuzz, assumedly, based on the aforementioned PR.\r\n\r\n**Failure logs** \r\nRelevant AzDO logs: https://dev.azure.com/NovelRT/NovelRT/_build/results?buildId=352&view=logs&j=7657cd23-e7c8-5f16-3eca-368b7743e6ae&t=cee3d295-27f3-503f-0cb1-8f6ca694b184\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nPlease note that Windows is completely unaffected.\r\n\r\nSince this happened on an AzDO machine and based on further testing, it came to light that installing freetype via vcpkg like this may cause it to rely on the local copy of harfbuzz that comes with Ubuntu as of 16.04 LTS, which is probably not the intended behaviour. This also suggests that Freetype still has a dependency on harfbuzz somewhere.\r\n\r\nPlease also note that I am certain it is the Harfbuzz changes due to the fact NovelRT is built daily on the master branch, and the last succeeding build for it was before #9888 was merged. It was fine before this.\r\n\r\nLinked is the PR in which this failure first occured, should you require it: \r\nhttps://github.com/novelrt/NovelRT/pull/126","closed_by